{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261104/photo/bkn-20261104221537863-1104_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261104232356\"/><p>兩車在路口相撞。（余宏基攝）</p><p>今晚(4日)約10時，兩輛私家車在長沙灣東京街及元州街交界發生碰撞，其中一名司機懷疑被困車內。救援人員抵達現場時，發現相關司機已自行逃出車廂，僅受輕傷，另一名司機則無恙。事故原因有待進一步調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T16:45:50.382413+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T14:15:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T16:38:48.569320+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T16:38:48.569320+00:00","content_hash":"2ee7bf58e3bcc29eee527f48242566b456663fd4e05cc88deea4acfa240642ec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}